    "A /v2/point response from adsb.lol, in the exact shape the live API returns.",
    "Values are synthetic (per docs/TEST_PLAN.md's fixture policy: no real registrations",
    "tied to identifiable private owners) but every structural quirk here was observed",
    "in a real response captured from api.adsb.lol during an audit:",
    "  - callsigns are space-padded to 8 characters ('EXS7YT  ' in the live sample)",
    "  - alt_baro is the STRING 'ground' for aircraft on the surface, not a number",
    "  - some records have no 'flight' field at all",
    "  - records carry ~52 fields, the overwhelming majority unused",
    "Each of those is a way a naive parser breaks. The firmware shipped with the",
    "padding bug for exactly this reason."
